// The northern seas (V2-10 (f)): the cold shelves of the North Atlantic and the North Pacific
// (their kelp forests, banks and rocky coasts) and the Arctic's ice-covered sea. Densities of
// the sea's animals are per km² of sea. The realms of the sea are its coasts': a North Pacific
// animal of the Nearctic is on both of that realm's coasts (D152).
(
    schema: 1,
