            temperament: (flight_m: 3, boldness: 0.2),
            notes: "The silver fish of the North Sea and the Baltic, in shoals of millions that come to the banks to spawn: salted, smoked and pickled, the fish that fed medieval Europe and built the Hanseatic towns; everything in the sea eats it.",
            realism_source: "general fish references; review",
